Metric:
- id: repo.deployment_readiness
- name: 
- description: This metric evaluates the quality and completeness of deployment scripts and automation processes within a code repository. It measures the extent to which these scripts facilitate reliable software rollouts and enable effective rollback procedures in case of failures. Key aspects assessed include the presence of automated testing, version control practices, and error handling mechanisms. The metric also considers the clarity and maintainability of the deployment documentation, which is crucial for team collaboration and knowledge transfer. Overall, it provides insights into the operational readiness of the software for production environments.

