Metric:
- id: data_pipeline
- name: 
- description: This metric evaluates the definitions and configurations of data pipelines implemented using orchestration tools such as Airflow, Prefect, and Kedro. It focuses on identifying critical aspects of pipeline robustness, including the presence of retry mechanisms, alerting systems, and observability features. The scope includes examining how well these pipelines can handle failures, notify stakeholders of issues, and provide insights into their operational performance. By highlighting deficiencies in these areas, the metric aims to promote best practices in data pipeline design and maintenance. Ultimately, it serves as a diagnostic tool to enhance the reliability and transparency of data workflows.

