Metric:
- id: ml.data_validation
- name: 
- description: This metric evaluates the integrity and consistency of data flowing through machine learning pipelines by analyzing schema adherence, value ranges, and data drift. It measures whether the incoming data conforms to predefined schemas, ensuring that the expected data types and structures are maintained. Additionally, it assesses the range of values to identify any anomalies or outliers that could impact model performance. The metric also monitors for data drift, which indicates changes in data distribution over time that may affect model accuracy. By highlighting missing quality gates or continuous integration (CI) integration points, this metric emphasizes the importance of robust data validation practices in maintaining high-quality datasets for training and inference.

